{201}{}{It's you! I thought of more questions. I had a list. I've got most of a list.}
{202}{}{Harden's dad got shot. Did you know? Everybody is being quiet at me. Can I ask you something anyway?}
{203}{}{I'm out of questions. I'm growing some more. You can have a secret while you wait.}

{210}{}{Go on, then. Ask.}
